mment\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"18\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\" /></svg>Comments</a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/4725596/quackyard\" target=\"_blank\" data-label=\"related_btn\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" height=\"18\" aria-hidden fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"18\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_very_large family_pangolin\"><div id=\"header\" class=\"header\"><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Quackyard</h1></div><div id=\"view_html_game_6649802\" class=\"view_html_game_page view_game_page page_widget base_widget direct_download ready\"><div id=\"html_embed_1230345\" class=\"html_embed_widget base_widget embed_wrapper\"><div class=\"game_frame game_pending\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" style=\"width: 1280px; height: 720px\"><button title=\"Enter fullscreen\" class=\"fullscreen_btn\"><img src=\"https://itch.io/static/images/enlarge.svg?1791312061\"/></button><div data-iframe=\"&lt;iframe mozallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; msallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; scrolling=&quot;no&quot; src=&quot;https://html-classic.itch.zone/html/18882047/index.html?v=1787238636&quot; allow=&quot;autoplay; fullscreen *; geolocation; microphone; camera; midi; monetization; xr-spatial-tracking; gamepad; gyroscope; accelerometer; xr; cross-origin-isolated; web-share&quot; allowtransparency=&quot;true&quot; id=&quot;game_drop&quot; webkitallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\" class=\"iframe_placeholder\"><button class=\"button load_iframe_btn\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_play\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Run game</button></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><h3 class=\"text-center\">Wishlist the full game on Steam! :)\r\n</h3>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/5001660/Quackyard/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwNTkyNzk0LnBuZw==/original/h47t4y.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><br></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><em>A cozy incremental farming sim about helping your duck friend clean out their backyard.</em><em><br>Dig, mine and farm your way to clearing up the space so that a tea party with friends can be hosted.</em></p>\r\n<p>This is an&nbsp;Itch.io exclusive&nbsp;<strong>Pre-Demo</strong> of the full game which is coming out&nbsp;March 2027.&nbsp;Since the game is currently work-in-progress, more content will be added to the full game than what you can play here, so be sure to wishlist the game if you want more.<br></p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<p>\r\n</p>\r\n<h3><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5MjEwNjY1LnBuZw==/original/azkbOu.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></h3>\r\n<h3><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5MjEwNjg5LmdpZg==/original/rxg8j7.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"></h3>\r\n<h3>Clear Space \uD83E\uDE8F</h3>\r\n<p>Dig and mine piles of junk, rubble and various boulders on Quacky&#x27;s backyard to clear out space for more plants, and to ultimately have space for a tea party. Extracted resources can be used to craft better items and upgrades.<br></p>\r\n<h3>Craft Upgrades \uD83D\uDC8E</h3>\r\n<p>Use  your ever exapnding arsenal of dozens of different resources to craft  better tools and upgrades that help in cleaning, farming or resource  production. Collect them all to reach the ultimate cleaning and farming  prowess!</p>\r\n<h3>Automate &amp; Optimize \uD83D\uDC30</h3>\r\n<p>Summon creatures to work for you so that you can just let the game run in the background or to make things faster.</p>\r\n<h3>Desktop Companion Mode \uD83E\uDD86</h3>\r\n<p>Quackyard  can also be played in desktop companion mode, this way the game runs in  a corner of your sceen while you do other things on your computer. Just press F5 to toggle between modes.&nbsp;<br>(desktop version only)</p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg height=\"6\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" width=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" role=\"img\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_7284864\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Updated</td><td><abbr title=\"06 October 2026 @ 08:54 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 9 hours ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/released\">Released</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/html5\">HTML5</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-windows\">Windows</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-linux\">Lin