 height=\"20\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" width=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" role=\"img\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_up\"><polygon points=\"2 18 12 6 22 18\" /></svg></a> <a data-register_action=\"community_vote\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fhugimugi7.itch.io%2Fquackyard&amp;intent=community\" title=\"Vote down\" class=\"vote_down_btn vote_btn\"><svg height=\"20\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" width=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" role=\"img\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_down\"><polygon points=\"2 6 12 18 22 6\" /></svg></a></div><a class=\"avatar_container\" href=\"https://itch.io/profile/pedrofigueira\"><div style=\"background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIzNTUyMjU5LnBuZw==/25x25%23/sGIYZz.png)\" class=\"post_avatar\"></div></a><div class=\"post_header\"><span class=\"post_author\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/profile/pedrofigueira\">Pedro Figueira</a></span><span title=\"2026-08-23 04:18:38\" class=\"post_date\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/post/17096381\">44 days ago</a></span><span class=\"vote_counts\"></span></div><div class=\"post_content\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"post_body user_formatted\"><p>Very good looking game. Also, a good premise. Something that makes me remember Plantasia.&nbsp;</p><p>Once the duck went off screen and I was worried about him.</p><p>1) Using autocliker is still much faster than the motor.&nbsp;</p><p>2) I tend to play with crafting tab opened, which makes the game field smaller. It could be a strip of options under the field, such as in RTS type games, or a fixed lateral strip, such as in citybuilding games.</p><p>3) When opening the crafting tab for the first time, I was confused as I needed to first click the icon for it to show recipe. Would it be better if the recipe appeared when hovering the icon?</p><p>4) Is the time for crafting a recipe really required? What is the purpose for a player to wait for it?</p><p>5) Could we click in the water ballon besides of the plant?&nbsp;</p></div><div class=\"post_fo